        "filing_date": "2026-05-21",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide the data connectivity required to build best-of-breed integrated marketing stacks, allowing our customers to innovate through their preferred choice of data, technology, and services providers.",
